# S14 (drop), guest g (a k10 character: k2 dies on the route's rock slope): the title gives it the room story at game
# start (the owner's card, without flag 505), so its engine lacks 505 as well although its own card has it (the
# lobby's check). It waits at the title until the owner has left, goes through the lobby into stag0101 and steps on
# matb01, whose hint panel sets 505: new to the room and plausible there (stag0101 sets it).
# Drop refuses it (owner_away) and records it in the room's dropped set; the engine keeps it for the rest of the
# stag0101 visit (never mid-stage) and the barrier into stag0102 removes it, with the notice.
# (matb01 lies on the west route at 229,-35: the route goes on from there to the exit matz02.)
idle until epoch>=@50
log owner gone
campaign until stage=stagml11
talk until control,frames>=60
log in the lobby
idle until frames>=300 fail flag:505=1
log 505 not in the lobby
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log in the field
mat matb01 no until flag:505=1
log 505 set
talk until control,frames>=60
route {route:stag0101_west>218,-26}
mat matz02 yes until stage=stag0102,control
log in stag0102
idle until frames>=120 fail flag:505=1
log 505 removed
idle until frames>=60
